sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant S as React SPA
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>S: e-mail and password
    S->>A: POST /auth/login
    A->>D: user by e-mail, bcrypt verify (cost 12)
    A->>D: refresh_token (hash, new family, ends at login + 12 h)
    A-->>S: 200 accessToken (8 h) and cookie rt (HttpOnly)
    S->>S: keep the access token in memory only
    Note over S,A: Page reload: the access token is lost
    S->>A: POST /auth/refresh (cookie rt, Origin checked)
    A->>D: consume token once, issue next one, same family and same end
    A-->>S: 200 new accessToken and rotated cookie
    Note over S,A: Reusing a rotated token revokes the family
    U->>S: log out
    S->>A: POST /auth/logout
    A->>D: revoke family
    A-->>S: 204, cookie cleared
